# Emrakul, the Exigent Doom has "Ward--Sacrifice three permanents" (CR 702.21a, 118.12). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 off three
# Black Lotuses and an Island, keeping a fourth Lotus: the exile ability works only from the hand, so Emrakul on the
# battlefield offers none though the Lotus could pay {3}. On turn 2 Bot2 Lightning Bolts Emrakul. Bot2 controls four
# permanents, agrees to pay, and chooses three of them, which are sacrificed together; the Bolt resolves and Emrakul,
# 12/12, takes 3.

